a policy shift, a new signal—each can ripple through tokenized

3
00:00:06,781 --> 00:00:10,171
markets while the headlines are quiet. Tidelight is built to

4
00:00:10,171 --> 00:00:13,562
help you follow that ripple with evidence, context, and a

5
00:00:13,562 --> 00:00:16,613
decision that stays yours. Start with the market map.

6
00:00:16,613 --> 00:00:20,924
This is Bitget’s public spot universe, including tokenized US equities.

7
00:00:20,924 --> 00:00:25,234
Quotes carry provider freshness and classification context. Tidelight is read-only

8
00:00:25,234 --> 00:00:29,544
here; browsing does not require an exchange key. From an

9
00:00:29,544 --> 00:00:31,268
