10
00:00:31,268 --> 00:00:35,068
Tidelight’s research desk is designed around source material you bring:

11
00:00:35,068 --> 00:00:38,867
ask a question, inspect the captured claims beside supporting passages,

12
00:00:38,867 --> 00:00:42,667
and keep the source link close. The system is bounded

13
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:46,467
by the evidence supplied. A useful answer should show what

14
00:00:46,467 --> 00:00:50,266
supports it, what might disagree, and what remains uncertain. Agent

15
00:00:50,266 --> 00:00:52,166
Flow makes the handoffs visible.

16
00:00:52,166 --> 00:00:56,182
The journey connects event, evidence, exposure, scenario, and decision. Research

17
00:00:56,182 --> 00:01:00,197
can map a company story to available instruments and risk

18
00:01:00,197 --> 00:01:04,213
context. When gates do not agree, the right outcome can

19
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:08,228
be to pause or hold. That is a research workflow—not

20
00:01:08,228 --> 00:01:09,433
